<title>NEW ZEALAND: HongkongBank cuts NZ fixed 1-yr rate to 10.25 pct.</title>
<headline>HongkongBank cuts NZ fixed 1-yr rate to 10.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>HongkongBank said on Wednesday it was cutting its New Zealand one-year fixed mortgage rate to 10.25 percent from 10.50 percent and expected to reduce its two to five-year fixed rates in the near future.</p>
</text>
